<header><p class="enc-kicker">Person</p><h1 class="enc-title">François de Laval</h1><p class="enc-meta"><span class="dates"><a href="/years/1623">1623</a>–<a href="/years/1708">1708</a></span> · <a href="/centuries/17th-century">17th century</a></p></header>
<div class="enc-body"><p class="enc-desc">François de Laval was the first Catholic <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/bishop">bishop</a> of <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/quebec">Quebec</a>, arriving in <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/new-france">New France</a> in 1659 as vicar apostolic and becoming bishop when the diocese was created in 1674. He founded the Seminary of Quebec in 1663, organised parishes and clashed with governors over the sale of brandy to indigenous peoples. Canonised in 2014, he gives his name to Université Laval.</p><figure class="enc-fig"><img src="/images/encyclopedia/francois-de-laval.jpg" alt="François de Laval" width="320" height="463" fetchpriority="high"><figcaption>Image: Public domain · <a href="https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Fran%C3%A7ois_de_Laval_-_Project_Gutenberg_eText_17174.jpg" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Wikimedia Commons</a></figcaption></figure></div>
<section class="enc-quotes"><h2 class="enc-section-title">Across the Institute</h2><ul><li><blockquote>The bishop of Quebec, beginning with <b>François de Laval</b>, vicar apostolic from 1658 and bishop from 1674, headed a powerful church that also founded the Séminaire de Québec in 1663.</blockquote><a href="/empire/new-france">New France · Governance &amp; Law</a></li></ul></section>
<section class="enc-where enc-born"><h2 class="enc-section-title">Born and died</h2><p class="enc-born-p">Born in Montigny-sur-Avre, in what is now <a href="/countries/france">France</a>. Died in Quebec City, in what is now <a href="/countries/canada">Canada</a>. <span class="enc-born-src">Places as Wikidata records them.</span></p><figure class="st-locator enc-loc"><a href="/atlas?at=48.73,1.02&amp;year=1678" aria-label="Montigny-sur-Avre on the atlas"><svg class="map map-loc" viewBox="4574 462 900 540" role="img" aria-label="Map: the birthplace of François de Laval"><image href="/maps/world.svg" x="0" y="0" width="10000" height="4393"/><path class="map-dot-halo" d="M5024 732h0"/><path class="map-dot-me" d="M5024 732h0"/></svg></a><figcaption>The dot marks the birthplace. <a href="/atlas?at=48.73,1.02&amp;year=1678">What was here in 1678? &rarr;</a></figcaption></figure></section>
